  "author": "DmitryDB",
  "description": "MiniMax H3 text-to-video on the 10Eros Max finetune, INT8 ConvRot build for RTX 30/40. Non-pruned weights: faster than the stock base despite being larger, because fewer layers need per-step dequantisation. Plain and Turbo-LoRA variants.",
