      "id": "minimax-h3-10eros-t2v",
      "name": "MiniMax H3 Text to Video (10Eros Max)",
      "icon": "🎬",
      "previewImage": "previews/minimax-h3-10eros-t2v.jpg",
      "description": "The 10Eros Max finetune of MiniMax H3 (INT8 ConvRot build), run through the unmodified official T2V graph — same sampler, scheduler and step count as the stock preset, so the model is the only difference.\n\nThis is the non-pruned base: full-width adaln (96768x16 against the stock 96768x8) and 30 layers left in BF16 that the stock weights store as int8. Because those layers skip per-step dequantisation, it runs FASTER than the smaller stock base despite being ~1.5 GB larger — measured 133.4s against the official preset's 171.4s at 5s/480p/20 steps on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti, a 22% improvement.\n\nWeights are 20.94 GiB. Free system RAM matters more than VRAM here — keep 16 GB+ free or timings degrade sharply.",
      "tagline": "Non-pruned 10Eros finetune on the stock H3 sampler",
